---SetRootShowDesState
---@param boolean boolean 技能描述界面开启状态
function UIBattlingUnitComboPanel:SetRootShowDesState(boolean)
    self.rootSkillDescAnimator.enabled = boolean
    if not boolean then
        self.cgRootSkillInfo.alpha = 0
    end
    KTool.SetActive(self.btnCloseComboDes, boolean)
end
